title: '[[id:f7f3be5e-0901-4892-bd12-fb3821ed308a][Don''t let the subject change so fast it confuses.]]'
pid: 041f1137-b67b-4090-8820-42d4d5de0674
body: |2-
  (Insecurity, over-eagerness to please, lack of empathy, attention)
  can lead one to jump around too much.
  Relax, believe in your message.
